@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Student {
    - studentId : String
}

class Room {
    - roomId : String
    - isBlocked : Boolean
    + isAvailable(startTime : DateTime, endTime : DateTime) : Boolean
    + block() : void
    + unblock() : void
    + bookingsForPeriod(startTime : DateTime, endTime : DateTime) : List<Booking>
}

class Booking {
    - bookingId : String
    - startTime : DateTime
    - endTime : DateTime
    - status : BookingStatus
    + cancel() : void
    + confirmationDetails() : String
}

enum BookingStatus {
    ACTIVE
    CANCELLED
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : reserved for

note right of Booking
    R1: startTime must be in the future.
    0 < endTime - startTime <= 2 hours.

    R2: ACTIVE bookings for the same Room
    must not overlap.

    Assumption: touching bookings are allowed.
    Overlap exists when:
    startA < endB and startB < endA.

    US-03: only the owning Student
    may cancel a Booking.

    R4: a successful booking
    produces confirmation.
end note

note right of Room
    R3: a blocked Room cannot
    accept a new Booking.

    Assumption: blocking a Room
    preserves existing bookings.

    US-05: usage can be derived from
    associated bookings for a selected period.
end note

@enduml